    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Did the crew of the Elkor find what they were looking for? Why?",
      "translation": "“埃尔科”号的船员们找到他们要找的东西了吗？为什么？",
      "startTime": 9.03,
      "endTime": 15.37,
      "analysis": {
